And I set field "budat" to "10.01."
And I set field "beleg" to "bu1"
And I set field "beldat" to "10.01."
And I set field "such" to "bu1"
And I create a new row at the end of the table
And I set field "konto" to "50000" in row 1
And I set field "ewsbetr" to "1" in row 1
